1
00:00:00,562 --> 00:00:02,830
Pilot tidak bebas terbang atau mendarat sendiri.

2
00:00:03,298 --> 00:00:05,754
Setiap gerakan di bandara menunggu izin.

3
00:00:06,214 --> 00:00:08,714
Di bandara sibuk, izin itu dibagi ke beberapa petugas.

4
00:00:08,878 --> 00:00:11,332
Delivery memberi izin rute.

5
00:00:11,586 --> 00:00:14,805
Ground mengatur pesawat di taxiway.

6
00:00:14,955 --> 00:00:16,492
Tower mengatur landasan.

7
00:00:16,988 --> 00:00:19,584
Kata-katanya diatur ketat.

8
00:00:19,734 --> 00:00:23,201
Line up and wait artinya masuk landasan lalu diam.

9
00:00:23,351 --> 00:00:25,182
Pesawat baru boleh terbang setelah

10
00:00:25,202 --> 00:00:27,034
mendengar cleared for takeoff.

11
00:00:27,184 --> 00:00:28,708
Setelah mengudara, Approach memakai

12
00:00:28,728 --> 00:00:30,851
radar untuk menjaga jarak antarpesawat.

13
00:00:31,339 --> 00:00:33,636
Taxiway juga punya lampu lalu lintas sendiri.

14
00:00:33,863 --> 00:00:36,016
Tepinya biru, garis tengahnya hijau.

15
00:00:36,166 --> 00:00:38,135
Di bandara yang memasangnya,

16
00:00:38,155 --> 00:00:40,908
ada stop bar merah melintang.

17
00:00:41,058 --> 00:00:42,746
Selama merah menyala,

18
00:00:42,766 --> 00:00:44,371
pilot tidak boleh melintas,

19
00:00:44,391 --> 00:00:45,875
meski sudah diberi izin lisan.

20
00:00:46,334 --> 00:00:47,917
Pesawat besar juga meninggalkan pusaran

21
00:00:47,937 --> 00:00:48,986
udara di belakangnya,

22
00:00:49,054 --> 00:00:51,479
jadi pesawat berikutnya diberi jarak lebih jauh.

23
00:00:51,629 --> 00:00:54,495
Di Indonesia, semua pemanduan ini dipegang

24
00:00:54,515 --> 00:00:56,595
satu lembaga, AirNav Indonesia.

25
00:00:57,088 --> 00:00:59,679
Langit ramai tetap tertib karena satu kata, izin.

26
00:00:59,829 --> 00:01:00,980
Ini AUDIRA Explained.
